---

## 2. Status flow

```
backlog → ready-for-dev → in-progress → review → done
```

| Status | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| `backlog` | No story file yet |
| `ready-for-dev` | Story file created, not yet started |
| `in-progress` | Dev agent executing |
| `review` | Dev done, review pending |
| `done` | Review fixes applied, verified, committed |

Epic statuses: `backlog` | `in-progress` | `done`

---

## 3. Branch naming (strict)

**Pattern:** `dev/epic-{E}-story-{E}-{S}`

- `{E}` = epic number (first segment of story key)
- `{S}` = story number (second segment of story key)

| Story key | Branch |
|-----------|--------|
| `3-1-match-shell-...` | `dev/epic-3-story-3-1` |
| `2-7-match-end-...` | `dev/epic-2-story-2-7` |

